        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-TEDDY_BEAR-BEAR-HEART-LEED-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-HEART-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-HOGAN-ENDOWMENT-SAAT     PIC 9(09) VALUE 001000000.
            05  WS-SSA-QUALIFIED            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-CLAYSCAPE-PLASTICITY-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-LEED-COMPLIANCE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-RULE18-PARITY-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-QUALIFIED-WITNESS  PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-TEDDY_BEAR-HEART-QUALIFICATION.
            GOBACK.
        1000-VERIFY-TEDDY_BEAR-HEART-QUALIFICATION.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-HOGAN-ENDOWMENT-SAAT = 001000000 AND
               WS-SSA-QUALIFIED = 1 AND
               WS-CLAYSCAPE-PLASTICITY-OK = 1 AND
               WS-LEED-COMPLIANCE-OK = 1 AND
               WS-RULE18-PARITY-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-TEDDY_BEAR-QUALIFIED-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-TEDDY_BEAR-QUALIFIED-WITNESS.
